{"id":"e6b661f277e95d9f","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-quantum-field.md","title":"Operator-Valued Distribution Quantum Field","display":"df-quantum-field — Operator-Valued Distribution Quantum Field","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-quantum-field","aliases":["58-df-quantum-field"],"display":"df-quantum-field — Operator-Valued Distribution Quantum Field","depends_on":["[[58-df-operator]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-hilbert-space]]","[[58-df-continuous-map]]","[[58-df-linear-map]]","[[58-df-smooth]]","[[58-df-smooth-manifold]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-quantum-field"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-quantum-field</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quantum-field — Operator-Valued Distribution Quantum Field"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e8c7b8a7c03e2ed\" href=\"?note=5e8c7b8a7c03e2ed\" title=\"58-df-operator\">58-df-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"58-df-hilbert-space\">58-df-hilbert-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"58-df-continuous-map\">58-df-continuous-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"58-df-linear-map\">58-df-linear-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"17de8347f6f91384\" href=\"?note=17de8347f6f91384\" title=\"58-df-smooth\">58-df-smooth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"58-df-smooth-manifold\">58-df-smooth-manifold</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n)\">\\((M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n)\\)</span> is a fixed smooth spacetime manifold structure, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal D(M),\\tau_{\\mathcal D})\">\\((\\mathcal D(M),\\tau_{\\mathcal D})\\)</span> is its complex test-function space, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\">\\((H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\\)</span> is a Hilbert space.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_H\\subseteq H\">\\(\\mathcal D_H\\subseteq H\\)</span> is a common invariant operator domain.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> maps each test function to a linear operator <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_H\\to H\">\\(\\mathcal D_H\\to H\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Operator}_{\\mathbb C}\">\\(\\operatorname{Operator}_{\\mathbb C}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb C}\\)</span> are supplied by the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseLinearDomain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseLinearDomain}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OperatorValuedDistribution}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OperatorValuedDistribution}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuantumField}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{QuantumField}_S\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}field\\text{-}dense\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DenseLinearDomain}_S(\\mathcal D_H,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{LinearSubspace}_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathcal D_H,H)\\land\n\\forall h\\in H\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists d\\in\\mathcal D_H\\;(\\|h-d\\|_H&lt;\\varepsilon)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}field\\text{-}dense\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DenseLinearDomain}_S(\\mathcal D_H,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{LinearSubspace}_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathcal D_H,H)\\land\n\\forall h\\in H\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists d\\in\\mathcal D_H\\;(\\|h-d\\|_H&lt;\\varepsilon)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}field\\text{-}operator\\text{-}valued\\text{-}distribution}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OperatorValuedDistribution}_S(\\Phi,\\mathcal D(M),\\tau_{\\mathcal D},H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H,\\mathcal D_H)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\Phi,\\mathcal D(M),H^{\\mathcal D_H}\\right)\\land\n\\forall f\\in\\mathcal D(M)\\;\\operatorname{Operator}_{\\mathbb C}(\\Phi(f);\\mathcal D_H,H,H)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb C}(\\Phi;\\mathcal D(M),H^{\\mathcal D_H})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathcal D_H\\;\\exists L_{\\psi,\\chi}\\;\\left[\n\\mathrm{Function}(L_{\\psi,\\chi},\\mathcal D(M),\\mathbb C)\\right.\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal D(M)\\;L_{\\psi,\\chi}(f)=\\langle\\psi,\\Phi(f)\\chi\\rangle_H\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\left.\\land\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb C}(L_{\\psi,\\chi};\\mathcal D(M),\\mathbb C)\\land\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(L_{\\psi,\\chi},\\mathcal D(M),\\tau_{\\mathcal D},\\mathbb C,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\right]\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}field\\text{-}operator\\text{-}valued\\text{-}distribution}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OperatorValuedDistribution}_S(\\Phi,\\mathcal D(M),\\tau_{\\mathcal D},H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H,\\mathcal D_H)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\Phi,\\mathcal D(M),H^{\\mathcal D_H}\\right)\\land\n\\forall f\\in\\mathcal D(M)\\;\\operatorname{Operator}_{\\mathbb C}(\\Phi(f);\\mathcal D_H,H,H)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb C}(\\Phi;\\mathcal D(M),H^{\\mathcal D_H})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathcal D_H\\;\\exists L_{\\psi,\\chi}\\;\\left[\n\\mathrm{Function}(L_{\\psi,\\chi},\\mathcal D(M),\\mathbb C)\\right.\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal D(M)\\;L_{\\psi,\\chi}(f)=\\langle\\psi,\\Phi(f)\\chi\\rangle_H\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\left.\\land\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb C}(L_{\\psi,\\chi};\\mathcal D(M),\\mathbb C)\\land\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(L_{\\psi,\\chi},\\mathcal D(M),\\tau_{\\mathcal D},\\mathbb C,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\right]\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}field}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{QuantumField}_S(\\Phi,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n,\\mathcal D(M),\\tau_{\\mathcal D},H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H,\\mathcal D_H)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n)\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\\land\n\\mathcal D(M)=C_c^\\infty(M,\\mathbb C)\\land\n\\mathrm{DenseLinearDomain}_S(\\mathcal D_H,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\\land\n\\mathrm{OperatorValuedDistribution}_S(\\Phi,\\mathcal D(M),\\tau_{\\mathcal D},H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H,\\mathcal D_H)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantum\\text{-}field}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{QuantumField}_S(\\Phi,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n,\\mathcal D(M),\\tau_{\\mathcal D},H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H,\\mathcal D_H)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n)\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\\land\n\\mathcal D(M)=C_c^\\infty(M,\\mathbb C)\\land\n\\mathrm{DenseLinearDomain}_S(\\mathcal D_H,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\\land\n\\mathrm{OperatorValuedDistribution}_S(\\Phi,\\mathcal D(M),\\tau_{\\mathcal D},H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H,\\mathcal D_H)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Distributional continuity is stated through all matrix coefficients <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\mapsto\\langle\\psi,\\Phi(f)\\chi\\rangle\">\\(f\\mapsto\\langle\\psi,\\Phi(f)\\chi\\rangle\\)</span>, avoiding an unspecified topology on unbounded operators.</li>\n<li>The Hilbert inner product and the spacetime smooth structure are explicit predicate arguments wherever norms, matrix coefficients, or test functions depend on them.</li>\n<li>Locality, covariance, the spectrum condition, and a distinguished vacuum are additional Wightman axioms, not part of the bare operator-valued-distribution notion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-operator","status":"resolved","id":"5e8c7b8a7c03e2ed","anchor":"ref-1","target